## STAGE 4: API RESPONSE PROBABILITIES (from model_service.py)

**Source**: `services/model_service.py` lines 137‑139

**Transformation**: Raw probabilities rounded to 4 decimal places
```
prob_home = round(raw_home, 4)  → 0.7245
prob_draw = round(raw_draw, 4)  → 0.2031
prob_away = round(raw_away, 4)  → 0.0724
