## LIVE TOURNAMENT DATA IMPACT

**YES** - 2026 FIFA World Cup results that are marked as `FINISHED` are actively used in features!

- Features using live WC results:
  - form_diff (last 5 matches, including WC matches)
  - gs_diff / gc_diff (goals scored/conceded last 5 matches)
  - attack/defence ratings (last 20 matches)
  - clean sheet rate, btts rate (last 20 matches)
  - Elo momentum (last 10 matches), strength of schedule (last 5 matches)

- Source DB tables: `matches` (status = 'FINISHED'), `team_elo`

